  The starting point for the free fit below is that second value, not
  a conditional regression.  Holding the rung below and estimating only
  Lambda and B2 lands in the INTERIOR by construction: at Lambda = 0 the
  transformed system has an AR root of modulus exactly one, so the rung
  below cannot be carried up unchanged, and the step off that boundary
  is chosen here by the likelihood rather than by a constant.

